# Files the coding agent never changes in bulking-app, one glob per line (Argus contract globs: ** crosses directories,
# * and ? stay in one path component). Read by the Argus harness from the job's commit, never from the working
# tree (SPEC_PROTECTED_FILES). A new test file (*.test.*) may be added (the drafter adds one); an existing one never
# changes. Build and tool configuration is executed at build or test time, so none of it may be added either.
